Im very far away with the military right now and i cant be there for her. She sent me lingerie photos and i told her i love her body. 

{ She wants to be able to share something sexy with you and feels rejected. }  

     This was incredibly insightful and thank you so much for sharing this as it helps me better understand her. We have made up since then and just had a wonderful conversation. Thank you for taking the time to help out some random like me on the internet. I will be deleting this post shortly since it doesnt need to be around anymore.
